    "value": "Complete original52-cost comparison on both entire actual saturated J faces. All25 previous scalar basis functions remain; only original cost41/cost47/cost48 bounds improve using272 actual common raw and survivor factorial crosses. Every original function keeps independently chosen original test labels. All59 exact whole-integer-load envelopes and59 fresh independent finite moment witnesses are checked against all25 updated constraints. Exact mass3/20, all signed payments, all four AP11 blocks, AP13 and the complete count tail are recomputed. The witnesses constrain only this updated scalar-moment method and need not be actual source configurations or coexist on one actual family. The old271 method bracket is not reused. No actual attainment, off-face/global join, unrestricted Erdos7 result or Lean verification is asserted."
